# parse-server 9.4.0 declares a Node range that stops below 26, so Yarn 1
# refuses to install it on Node 26. The engine field is advisory: the server
# runs fine there, and the version that adds Node 26 to that field (9.11.0)
# changes how a master-key signup and a pointer `$in` query behave, which this
# suite cannot absorb. Ignore the field until a parse-server release adds Node
# 26 support without those changes.
ignore-engines true
